、楊不足，至於檢己，老而益明，亦難能也。","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p014:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"魚豢","kind":"person","person_id":"q2w_dba_ozq","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整裴潛單元及具體上下文辨識；原字及見證層次保留。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p014:m0028","start":28,"end":31,"surface":"劉仲始","kind":"person","person_id":"jhy_pa4_8xt","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整裴潛單元及具體上下文辨識；原字及見證層次保留。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p014:m0093","start":93,"end":94,"surface":"徐","kind":"person","person_id":"d1c_f9d_yc9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"卷023明指諸葛亮傳的徐福；對讀固定卷035明徐庶元直及庶先名福，沿既有元直身份；絕非秦方士徐巿。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p014:m0095","start":95,"end":96,"surface":"嚴","kind":"person","person_id":"v2q_174_14w","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整裴潛單元及具體上下文辨識；原字及見證層次保留。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p014:m0117","start":117,"end":118,"surface":"李","kind":"person","person_id":"lwm_a4z_q9p","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整裴潛單元及具體上下文辨識；原字及見證層次保留。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p014:m0122","start":122,"end":123,"surface":"張","kind":"person","person_id":"lpc_1gj_ahs","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整裴潛單元及具體上下文辨識；原字及見證層次保留。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p014:m0127","start":127,"end":128,"surface":"韓","kind":"person","person_id":"sdf_7gn_zow","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整裴潛單元及具體上下文辨識；原字及見證層次保留。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p014:m0132","start":132,"end":133,"surface":"黃","kind":"person","person_id":"pix_akk_jz0","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整裴潛單元及具體上下文辨識；原字及見證層次保留。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p014:m0157","start":157,"end":159,"surface":"游翁","kind":"person","person_id":"d40_cx2_vot"